  "description": "In a world that expects carnivore hybrids to be fierce and herbivores to be pure, Lee Tae-Jun is a timid tiger who never quite fits the mold. Working quietly at his childhood friend’s convenience store, he lives weighed down by self-doubt and the pressure to suppress his true self. One night, he meets Hwa Seo-Yun, a sheep model whose drunken visit leads to Tae-Jun’s first time. While Tae-Jun shyly longs for another meeting, Seo-Yun finds himself drawn to the tiger’s gentle, self-effacing nature. As they grow closer, the two discover comfort and kinship in choosing to live true to themselves.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
